# Eastron SDM230.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Eastron SDM230 (SDM230-2T) — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: eastron-sdm230-modbus-protocol.pdf (V1.1)
# | - Single-phase smart meter (2-wire RS485).
# | - All measured values are IEEE-754 FLOAT (f32), MSW first (big-endian) — word_order omitted.
# | - All measurements use INPUT registers (FC04). Addresses are 0-based protocol addresses
# | (manual shows 30001-based: subtract 30001).
# | - Energy units: kWh / kVArh (already in engineering units, no scale).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600 (code 2), 8N1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Eastron
@model=SDM230
@description=Single-phase DIN-rail smart meter — V/I/P/Q/S, PF, phase angle, frequency, import/export energy with tariff bands (IEEE-754 float, input registers).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/eastron-sdm230.toml; Source: eastron-sdm230-modbus-protocol.pdf (V1.1). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

